  "notes": "Three copies of the same pinout: top view with castellated pads on left, bottom and right edges, and bottom view (silkscreen ESP32-S3-Tiny) with two inner columns of 7 labeled pads. Castellated edges in the bottom view are unlabeled there and duplicate the top-view pads, so they are not repeated. GP7/GP8 callouts on the left and GP9-GP11 on the right lead to bottom-edge pads silkscreened 7-11. Category-only tags (UART, PWM, I2S, ADC, I2C, SPI) omitted. Legend 'WS2812 RGB LED used pins GP38 DIN' is not tied to a pad and is noted here only."
}
